+for terminal Tasks. LOO-312 completion appeared hung then succeeded; Jack required
+it unfinished and `lf task reopen LOO-312` restored unstarted/completed=false
+without moving Workflow. Completion delay remains undiagnosed: distinguish
+command time from stream-checkpoint confirmation without another real completion.
+Controls use existing owners and Abandon confirmation; focused tests passed.
+
+Other unresolved feedback: Etude Hook failed/exit 1 has no established cause;
+AttributeGraph cycles were separately logged. Jack requested Fantasia renamed
