+the primary Session or explicit zoom. First visible occurrence owns the native
+mount. Entering a Task and returning changes presentation without moving its
+panes, drafts or conversation. Passive grids never acquire a client.
+
+Automatic grids give waiting Work priority and space. Resizing preserves the
+surviving arrangement; arrivals append, departures collapse. Title-bar breadcrumbs
+follow hierarchy, Back follows visits, and Cmd+K routes cross-repository Work to
+its own window. Task selection uses the full workspace without a sidebar.
+Editable Dashboards, cross-machine layout persistence and transport are separate
+owners; built-in grids do not introduce their own storage or Session pool.
 
